+// Codex WebSocket: duplicate keys on the first response.create frame, and a
+// duplex follow-up response.create continuation that reintroduces the field
+// (7.3 duplex streaming re-prepares every continuation through
+// prepareCodexWebsocketStream; the boundary must hold on each frame).
